1
00:00:00,700 --> 00:00:02,733
ATEM won't connect?

2
00:00:03,533 --> 00:00:06,650
CastPad keeps knocking, but nothing answers.

3
00:00:06,950 --> 00:00:09,050
Check the first three numbers.

4
00:00:09,150 --> 00:00:11,367
Your phone and router match.

5
00:00:11,417 --> 00:00:14,433
Your ATEM's factory address doesn't.

6
00:00:14,733 --> 00:00:17,233
Same router, different network.

7
00:00:17,733 --> 00:00:21,150
CastPad even tells you: different IP range.

8
00:00:21,400 --> 00:00:26,967
Fix it in ATEM Setup: turn on DHCP, or pick an address in your range.

9
00:00:27,167 --> 00:00:29,500
Rescan, and you're connected.

10
00:00:30,600 --> 00:00:34,567
Try it in your browser, at castpad.app/demo.
